{"fw_ld4_quick_e_0006","any",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{1,"If we find a radio, don't start bossing me over who holds it",2,"Why would I?",1,"Because you always say, because I said so",2,"That's a stupid reason",1,"That's what I keep telling you",2,"Fine. First thing we do is agree who listens, not who owns it"}},
